        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "3a9592f8-da11-39a4-82b4-a50e3f666c04",
                "word": "frugalité",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "5cf8e395-4b3b-4c35-a0e2-19bec5d72dbc",
                        "entry_id": "3a9592f8-da11-39a4-82b4-a50e3f666c04",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "frugalités"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e6ebb99a-d8aa-33cb-b7be-df141bd308bf",
                        "entry_id": "3a9592f8-da11-39a4-82b4-a50e3f666c04",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qualité de celui qui est frugal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "66bd9db0-4400-42b1-8345-a7c246cfabbb",
                                "sense_id": "e6ebb99a-d8aa-33cb-b7be-df141bd308bf",
                                "text": "Il faut donc s’habituer à manger sobrement et simplement, sans rechercher toutes ces viandes délicatement préparées ; la santé trouve dans cette frugalité sa conservation, et l’homme, par ce moyen, devient plus robuste et beaucoup plus propre à toutes les actions de la vie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d92a47da-252c-46b6-80cb-bd6267f4fdbc",
                                "sense_id": "e6ebb99a-d8aa-33cb-b7be-df141bd308bf",
                                "text": "A la même époque, Malcolm Flemyng, médecin à Édimbourg, recommande lui aussi, en 1760, de manger avec frugalité, de préférence une alimentation monotone, riche en légumes, racines et verdure, mais sans adjonction de beurre, de tromper sa faim en se remplissant l’estomac de fruits de saison […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0f89a888-beb3-3bc2-a04d-9636a0708d43",
                        "entry_id": "3a9592f8-da11-39a4-82b4-a50e3f666c04",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qualité de ce qui est frugal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbda2aac-4ba5-45d2-9065-53bf430f8b3f",
                                "sense_id": "0f89a888-beb3-3bc2-a04d-9636a0708d43",
                                "text": "On leur a prescrit la frugalité dans les repas, l’usage de la viande seulement trois fois par semaine, […], et voici que leurs tables plient sous le poids d’une nourriture délicate et recherchée !"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "db69646f-4760-455c-b9ef-1acbb88600f0",
                        "source_entry_id": "3a9592f8-da11-39a4-82b4-a50e3f666c04",
                        "target_lang_word": "frugality",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "frugality",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca4ddf91-8b99-3f5b-aba7-0784a971e559",
                                        "entry_id": "535aa1b4-919b-3adc-8688-6f4947200e78",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being frugal; prudent economy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "999a6655-284a-4241-ad50-312292805547",
                                                "sense_id": "ca4ddf91-8b99-3f5b-aba7-0784a971e559",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: (usually admirable) economy, thrift, thriftiness, parsimony; (excessive degree) tightness, stinginess; (extreme degree) miserliness; see also Thesaurus:frugal, Thesaurus:stingy"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ab2a3f5-591b-4a1c-9217-222f2e9b8483",
                                                "sense_id": "ca4ddf91-8b99-3f5b-aba7-0784a971e559",
                                                "text": "Your sense of honour and honesty would have led you, I know, when aware of your situation, to attempt all the economy that would appear to you possible; and, perhaps, as long as your frugality retrenched only on your own comfort, you might have been suffered to practice it, but beyond that—"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed36aa4a-b1b9-4f5b-b74f-c24a69c920dc",
                                                "sense_id": "ca4ddf91-8b99-3f5b-aba7-0784a971e559",
                                                "text": "With the frugality that hard graft begets, his mate limited both his and her own tobacco, so he must not smoke all afternoon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "631883e1-4137-3b90-8280-10b3d6533582",
                                        "entry_id": "535aa1b4-919b-3adc-8688-6f4947200e78",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sparing use; sparingness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8ac02b3b-dbce-4657-94f3-ae1457086aae",
                        "source_entry_id": "3a9592f8-da11-39a4-82b4-a50e3f666c04",
